CLASS zcl_az_http_pipeline DEFINITION
  PUBLIC
  FINAL
  CREATE PUBLIC.

  PUBLIC SECTION.

     TYPES tt_policies TYPE STANDARD TABLE OF REF TO zif_az_http_pipeline_policy WITH EMPTY KEY.

    METHODS constructor
      IMPORTING
        it_policies TYPE tt_policies.

    METHODS send
      IMPORTING
        io_request TYPE REF TO zcl_az_http_request
      RETURNING
        VALUE(ro_response) TYPE REF TO zcl_az_http_response
        RAISING zcx_az_http_error.

  PRIVATE SECTION.

    DATA mt_policies TYPE tt_policies.

ENDCLASS.



CLASS ZCL_AZ_HTTP_PIPELINE IMPLEMENTATION.


METHOD constructor.
  mt_policies = it_policies.
ENDMETHOD.


METHOD send.

  DATA(lo_context) =
    NEW zcl_az_pipeline_context(
        mt_policies ).

  ro_response =
    lo_context->next( io_request ).

ENDMETHOD.
ENDCLASS.